  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef has AAA notebooks with him, each having a total of BBB pages.\n\nEach page has 505050 lines drawn to be written on, and you can write on both sides of the pages. Chef has to follow the drawn lines when writing. Thus, he can only write 505050 lines on the front side of the page, and 505050 lines on the back side.\n\nWhat is the effective total number of lines that Chef can write across all his notebooks?\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first and only line of input contains 222 integers - AAA and BBB.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line the total number of lines Chef can write.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤A≤101 \\le A \\le 101≤A≤10",
      "1≤B≤1001 \\le B \\le 1001≤B≤100"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "1 1",
        "output": "100",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nChef has 111 notebook with 111 page only. He can write 505050 lines on the front, and 505050 lines on the back side of the page, for a total of 100100100 lines."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "5 50",
        "output": "25000",
        "explanation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
